# the mod wheel: the DJ filter on the whole mix (smk37.c lsmk_modw, engine.c dj_run): up a low-pass, PATCH held a high-pass;
# dj.wav, a held poly note through both (the run_tests WAVs)
wait 3000
turn ALGO 2
wait 200
param 3 cut 127
wait 100
wav dj.wav
key 7 down 100
wait 700
modw 120
wait 700
modw 0
wait 400
press HOME
modw 110
wait 700
release HOME
wait 100
modw 0
wait 400
key 7 up
wait 300
wavstop
